# Runtime state: per-machine artifacts that should never be version-controlled.
# These are observations about local runs, not assets that travel with the skill.
#
# Policy: anything autobuilder writes at runtime (postmortem / evolve / failure
# capsules / audit caches / loop receipts staged here) goes in this list.
# Anything vendored from the source skill (prompts/, rules/, schemas/, scripts/,
# templates/, SKILL.md, install.sh, .gitignore) does NOT belong here.
#
# When a subcommand starts writing a new state path under skill/, add it below.

# Stage 5 — postmortem queues + evolve reports / patches.
proposals/

# Subcommand-local caches (no producer writes these today, but reserved so any
# future "warm cache" landing under skill/ is ignored by default).
*.cache/
.cache/

# Per-run audit + log byproducts. The audit script writes to /tmp by default,
# but if a future detector lands a temp file under the skill dir we don't want
# it committed.
*.log
*.tmp

# Editor/OS detritus.
.DS_Store
*.swp
